       ((SELECT id FROM challenge.challenges WHERE public_id = 'chal_coding_gha_132'), 2, 'Look at `strategy.fail-fast`, `strategy.matrix` with `include`, `jobs.<id>.continue-on-error` with a matrix expression, and a service container''s `image`, `ports` and `options` (the `--health-*` flags).'),
       ((SELECT id FROM challenge.challenges WHERE public_id = 'chal_coding_gha_132'), 3, 'A Redis-backed job on the runner tested on two Redis versions: `matrix: { redis: [7, 8] }`, `services: { redis: { image: "redis:${{ matrix.redis }}", ports: ["6379:6379"], options: "--health-cmd ''redis-cli ping'' --health-interval 5s" } }`, and `REDIS_URL: redis://localhost:6379` on the test step.');
